  {"instruction": "How to set OVS controller fail-mode in ODL", "output": "curl -u admin:admin -X PUT -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"node\":[{\"node-id\":\"br0\",\"fail-mode\":\"standalone\"}]}' http://localhost:8181/restconf/config/network-topology:network-topology/topology/ovsdb:1/node/br0"},
